name visualtoks
category Package
revision 76207
shortdesc Typeset TeXbook-style visualisations of token lists
longdesc This package provides the \visualtoks command to display
longdesc arbitrary list of tokens, for pedagogical or debugging
longdesc purposes, in a style inspired by Knuth's TeXbook. The package
longdesc may be used in plain TeX or LaTeX.
